# Enterprise Search Autocomplete (FROZEN)

## Pattern

Type → Select → Dropdown closes → Value populated → Continue working

Never leave the results list open after selection. Never require manual dismissal.

## Display

- Show results only after the user types
- Filtered matches only (max 8)
- Compact height (`max-h-40`) with internal scroll
- Absolute overlay — do not push / dominate the form

## SSOT

- Constants: `src/constants/enterprise-search-autocomplete.ts`
- Primatives: `EntityMasterSearch`, `LiveEntityMasterSearch`, `EnterpriseLenderSearch`, `CitySelect`, `EcmMasterSelect`

Applies to Contact, Company, Lender, Partner, Opportunity, Deal, and Product registry lookups.
